</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/38acb6d4-9327-11f1-a384-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-08T092202Z-297863489-RC29UMAUO1BR-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-SERBIA-ZELENSKIY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/38acb6d4-9327-11f1-a384-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-08T092202Z-297863489-RC29UMAUO1BR-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-SERBIA-ZELENSKIY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">88d1cba4-9327-11f1-8cde-11b22b280748</guid><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 12:49:02 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>林兰</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻分析</category><title>移民冲击在欧盟成员国之间撕开了一道裂口</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/20260807-%E7%A7%BB%E6%B0%91%E5%86%B2%E5%87%BB%E5%9C%A8%E6%AC%A7%E7%9B%9F%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%9B%BD%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E6%92%95%E5%BC%80%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E9%81%93%E8%A3%82%E5%8F%A3</link><description>
7.2万人上周突然从摩洛哥涌来，登陆西班牙飞地休达，马德里当局措手不及，更让邻国惶惶不可终日。人员自由流动的申根区突然让一些人觉得是一个陷阱，罗马率先叫停申根协议，对西班牙方向入境者恢复检查。星期五，马德里采取反制措施，对从意大利入境者实施边境检查。
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e1f17aba-92a8-11f1-b687-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T125050Z-2084180962-RC22TMADKWTO-RTRMADP-3-MIGRATION-EUROPE-SPAIN-CEUTA-ITALY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e1f17aba-92a8-11f1-b687-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T125050Z-2084180962-RC22TMADKWTO-RTRMADP-3-MIGRATION-EUROPE-SPAIN-CEUTA-ITALY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">6ba1b404-92b4-11f1-b650-7fe8a2c6e8aa</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 23:10:29 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>安德烈</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>泽连斯基将出访塞尔维亚</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260806-%E6%B3%BD%E8%BF%9E%E6%96%AF%E5%9F%BA%E5%B0%86%E5%87%BA%E8%AE%BF%E5%A1%9E%E5%B0%94%E7%BB%B4%E4%BA%9A</link><description>
